/*
  FeedbackModal.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 modal/dialog · 0004 · FeedbackModal (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. Every key the native
  FeedbackModal resolves (table "FeedbackModal") lives here with its web
  `t(key, default)` English value. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a
  per-surface table so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings without
  editing the shared catalog.

  The first group is the exact keys extracted from the web source
  (components/feedback/FeedbackModal.tsx). The remainder backs the native state
  envelope (context loading / empty / error retry, freshness chip, connectivity
  banner), the header close affordance, and the native field-validation messages
  (the parity of the zod min/max issues), plus the {{0}} / {{count}} placeholders
  that the i18n facade substitutes.
*/

